libfmos
------------------------------------------
libfmos is a library for Mac OS data types.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libfmos-devel-20260520-1bl1
  libfmos1-20260520-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfmos

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfmos/archive/refs/tags/20260520.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfmos-20260520-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfmos-20260520-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfmos-20260520-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfmos-20260520-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfmos1-20260520-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfmos-devel-20260520-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libfmos-20260520-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfmos)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfmos.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfmos/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfmos/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfmos/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfmos/README

(libfmos1)
  /usr/bin/cygfmos-1.dll

(libfmos-devel)
  /usr/include/libfmos.h
  /usr/include/libfmos/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfmos/error.h
  /usr/include/libfmos/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfmos/features.h
  /usr/include/libfmos/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfmos.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfmos.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfmos.3.gz

(python312-libfmos)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfmos.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

